      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "在抱团过程的量化刻画上，研报构建了超额收益、持股分化（估值分化指数）、增量资金三要素跟踪框架，并通过多个历史周期复盘归纳出一般性规律：",
      "path": "assets/figure_004.png",
      "sha256": "4ddc7f0350bcbcd194059888bf7898e1d7966990e76e841f1c16f864a1895666",
      "bytes": 288481,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 396,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/059347ff-1993-4a28-82f2-3393f1757408.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/59bf21a7-e7b6-424f-ad07-b0cf6ea733ef.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "在增量资金视角下，不同市场环境对应不同的主导资金，不同资金又有截然不同的审美与偏好。",
      "path": "assets/figure_005.png",
      "sha256": "f1cdebd275aaad05dd9418973b61bee3e9c50f264a82e22398805fb9771fd50f",
      "bytes": 543091,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 491,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/59bf21a7-e7b6-424f-ad07-b0cf6ea733ef.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/3faeb19e-dd80-4913-b4ef-d3ff1ca036b8.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "报告构建了\"基于高增长细分—流动性—供给侧优化\"的三因素A股投资策略轮回框架，将主观多头投资理念归纳为三种核心范式：",
      "path": "assets/figure_006.png",
      "sha256": "1460a99cc8f1a590f95a4cba803dd6bf5455a99c2db06a42c8a927fddbb1eb04",
      "bytes": 325542,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 490,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/3faeb19e-dd80-4913-b4ef-d3ff1ca036b8.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/c378d1e7-5c96-4055-949b-41933f7b8648.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "其中，高增长细分行业定义为：中信三级行业中利润增速超过30%的行业占比。",
      "path": "assets/figure_007.png",
      "sha256": "46a66c453b0c04ea11fa170e8df4f8acf93558907e93f8728a45dd77de61edf0",
      "bytes": 510954,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 402,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/c378d1e7-5c96-4055-949b-41933f7b8648.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/be110e25-543e-4717-b917-93ec3180c0ed.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "报告判断，在季度到半年的短期风格维度上，科技与周期之间的\"新旧共舞\"是明确的，根本指引仍来自PPI的回升方向。",
      "path": "assets/figure_008.png",
      "sha256": "1e130f47279d5d9b998ddb015bb0d5224162062b9856518e9907786c0c085144",
      "bytes": 392322,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 496,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/be110e25-543e-4717-b917-93ec3180c0ed.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d166ca6f-9c62-408d-bbd6-a98722e79770.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "同样，单独的宏观巨变若缺乏仓位失衡配合，市场通常只出现阶段性\"高切低\"调整，原有主线大概率回归。以2025年对等关税落地为例，市场仅出现单日下跌后迅速V型反转，原因正是各板块仓位并未严重失衡。",
      "path": "assets/figure_009.png",
      "sha256": "38423c1307b9668593bb9d1a04c3d12e95731a119497645a9b406a99849e8da2",
      "bytes": 323995,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 468,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d166ca6f-9c62-408d-bbd6-a98722e79770.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/5beb1462-1857-4eff-9207-31443c43cb6e.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "当10年期国债收益率出现大幅下行时，悲观预期驱动资金向两端配置，形成典型杠铃结构；而当国债收益率进入震荡区间、不再持续下行时，对中期经济的悲观预期有所缓解，资金将逐步从两端向中间资产（创业板指、A500、中证500等大盘成长资产）回流，\"反杠铃\"逻辑随之成立。",
      "path": "assets/figure_010.png",
      "sha256": "e5ca102f7df01cd016d94c364454e1d00af1b0e1b733fa820ed8b76a7df3ac29",
      "bytes": 514983,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 529,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/5beb1462-1857-4eff-9207-31443c43cb6e.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/71a1d3f1-7454-444b-b499-07cc38e23476.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "对于更短期的行业轮动，团队构建了\"A股高切低指数\"，构建方法为计算各二级行业累计收益率的方差：",
      "path": "assets/figure_011.png",
      "sha256": "1de5af3696a932ba4552319882176a5d24b0e0fdb37519716ad94f454cfbe54a",
      "bytes": 637762,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 515,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/71a1d3f1-7454-444b-b499-07cc38e23476.png"
    },
